<title>UK: Port conditions update - Nigeria - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Nigeria - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions for Nigeria from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>LONDON, Oct 31 - Situation today - Lagos port operating normally. All terminals report no berthing delays. Port Harcourt - port quiet, no berthing delays reported. All crude terminals loading according to programme.</p>
</text>
